accounts | User authentication, Google OAuth integration, and cookie JWT authentication.\par
sources | Source records, API/PDF ingestion, Gemini embedding, Qdrant indexing, and retrieval.\par
chat | Chat sessions, user messages, assistant messages, and query orchestration.\par
frontend pages | Login, dashboard, add-source, and source-specific chat user interfaces.\par
